WEBVTT

00:01:56.640 --> 00:01:58.140
You won't progress to the next grade.

00:01:59.860 --> 00:02:03.470
Not if this is the score you get on your Summer Trial Exam.

00:02:04.180 --> 00:02:06.440
This was only a quiz.

00:02:08.690 --> 00:02:12.400
Those who can't advance to the next grade will be forced to withdraw from Kazalm.

00:02:14.410 --> 00:02:20.410
For those who are from a wealthy family, they can remain by paying a year's worth of tuition.

00:02:22.450 --> 00:02:26.870
I can't ask Jone Oji-san to pay something like that.

00:02:26.870 --> 00:02:30.680
Then you'll have to catch up on the material.

00:02:30.680 --> 00:02:36.770
Just because I left you in charge of Lilan doesn't mean I have any intention of giving you special treatment.

00:02:36.770 --> 00:02:37.930
Of course.

00:02:42.830 --> 00:02:44.530
That's Lilan's voice.

00:02:44.530 --> 00:02:46.390
I'm sorry, Esal-sensei.

00:02:48.510 --> 00:02:53.670
Lilan gets worried when I'm not around and wanders around looking for me.

00:02:53.670 --> 00:02:54.610
Excuse me.

00:03:08.800 --> 00:03:10.410
Lilan!

00:03:13.740 --> 00:03:15.390
Did you miss me?

00:03:19.050 --> 00:03:21.430
Yes, yes, I get it.

00:03:21.430 --> 00:03:23.300
I'm sorry I left you alone.

00:03:38.300 --> 00:03:42.610
I have to study hard so I don't flunk out.

00:03:45.260 --> 00:03:51.170
Lilan's Heart

00:04:11.270 --> 00:04:13.350
I'm studying right now.

00:04:13.350 --> 00:04:16.860
"The shape of the clouds change depending on the season.

00:04:17.360 --> 00:04:19.300
The nimbostratus clouds drop rain.

00:04:19.300 --> 00:04:22.550
The altostratus clouds cover the sky like a film.

00:04:22.550 --> 00:04:24.970
The Lilan clouds are often seen in fall."

00:04:27.110 --> 00:04:28.700
I mean the <i>altocumulus</i> clouds!

00:04:29.410 --> 00:04:32.330
Gosh, you made me read it wrong.

00:04:32.330 --> 00:04:35.710
Lilan, this is no time to play.

00:04:35.710 --> 00:04:40.540
If I fail the exam, I can't be with you, do you understand?

00:04:42.560 --> 00:04:44.340
Do you understand that I'm upset with you?

00:04:52.310 --> 00:04:53.810
Erin...

00:04:57.440 --> 00:04:58.900
Yuuyan.

00:05:03.430 --> 00:05:05.660
What's wrong, Yuuyan?!

00:05:12.050 --> 00:05:13.360
"Broken heart?"

00:05:13.870 --> 00:05:15.420
Yeah.

00:05:15.790 --> 00:05:23.420
The other day, when Kashugan went into town, he bought a yellow hairpin after spending a long time considering which one to get!

00:05:26.160 --> 00:05:29.730
I bet he's giving it to his girlfriend!

00:05:29.730 --> 00:05:32.640
He's going to give it to her when he returns home over the summer break!

00:05:33.390 --> 00:05:37.230
It could be a souvenir for his mother.

00:05:37.230 --> 00:05:38.520
Why don't you ask him?

00:05:38.520 --> 00:05:43.070
No!  It has to be for his girlfriend who must look good in yellow!

00:05:47.960 --> 00:05:49.510
Likes me.

00:05:49.510 --> 00:05:51.040
Likes me not.

00:05:51.040 --> 00:05:53.110
Likes me.

00:05:53.110 --> 00:05:54.760
Likes me not.

00:05:54.760 --> 00:05:56.000
Likes me.

00:05:56.000 --> 00:05:57.840
Likes me not.

00:05:57.840 --> 00:05:59.250
Likes me.

00:05:59.250 --> 00:06:00.590
Likes me not.

00:06:00.590 --> 00:06:02.330
Likes me.

00:06:02.330 --> 00:06:04.380
Likes me not.

00:06:04.380 --> 00:06:06.110
Likes me.

00:06:06.110 --> 00:06:07.660
Likes me not.

00:06:07.660 --> 00:06:09.850
Likes me... not.

00:06:15.500 --> 00:06:18.070
He's got someone!

00:06:20.440 --> 00:06:22.670
Are you sure there's someone like that?

00:06:22.670 --> 00:06:24.530
I'd better go ask.

00:06:24.530 --> 00:06:30.180
No!  Don't go deepening the scar on my heart!

00:06:30.180 --> 00:06:31.560
But...

00:06:31.560 --> 00:06:36.250
Please.  If I just cry through the night, I'll be fine.

00:06:49.420 --> 00:06:51.970
What are you doing out here?

00:06:53.000 --> 00:06:57.420
Ah, I couldn't find a place where I could concentrate and study.

00:06:59.660 --> 00:07:02.510
Sorry.  Thank you for letting me use the dining room.

00:07:02.510 --> 00:07:03.770
No problem.

00:07:04.150 --> 00:07:06.820
Go!  Go!  Erin-chan!

00:07:06.820 --> 00:07:08.450
We'll be rooting for you!

00:07:08.850 --> 00:07:11.070
You guys are a bother!

00:07:13.400 --> 00:07:18.870
I understand how you can't concentrate when you're with Lilan, but why can't you study in your own room?

00:07:19.480 --> 00:07:20.840
Because there's a broken heart-

00:07:21.580 --> 00:07:23.540
I mean...  Nothing.

00:07:24.410 --> 00:07:26.010
"Broken heart?"

00:07:26.810 --> 00:07:29.380
Um, please don't worry about it.

00:07:32.220 --> 00:07:35.580
Do you have someone you like?

00:07:35.580 --> 00:07:36.680
Ah, no!

00:07:42.810 --> 00:07:45.660
What are you having trouble with?

00:07:45.660 --> 00:07:47.560
I'll tutor you.

00:07:47.560 --> 00:07:48.800
Really?

00:07:48.800 --> 00:07:52.000
But don't you have the Graduation Trial Exam?

00:07:52.550 --> 00:07:57.870
I'm smart, so I don't have to cram it in at the last minute.

00:07:59.010 --> 00:08:01.920
After all, I am the top student in the High School class.

00:08:08.070 --> 00:08:09.630
Flashcards?

00:08:11.630 --> 00:08:14.200
To tell you the truth, I'm having difficulty memorizing them.

00:08:14.200 --> 00:08:16.870
So I was working on them as I was walking around.

00:08:30.010 --> 00:08:31.210
What?

00:08:31.210 --> 00:08:37.870
I'm sorry.  But I sort of feel relieved seeing you having a hard time, too.

00:08:37.870 --> 00:08:43.790
When I'm watching you, I'm not sure if all this studying is worthwhile or not.

00:08:44.310 --> 00:08:47.800
But, let us both do our best and become beastinarians.

00:08:48.170 --> 00:08:49.170
Right.

00:08:53.870 --> 00:08:56.680
I've got to do my best for Lilan's sake, too.

00:09:13.930 --> 00:09:15.750
I summarized the key points.

00:09:15.750 --> 00:09:17.360
Use it as a reference.

00:09:17.360 --> 00:09:20.770
Well, I know you were occupied with taking care of Lilan.

00:09:29.410 --> 00:09:31.840
Urari.  Thank you.

00:09:32.210 --> 00:09:34.300
Isn't that nice?  Erin's so special.

00:09:35.300 --> 00:09:36.540
Let me see it, too!

00:09:36.540 --> 00:09:37.700
Please.

00:09:37.700 --> 00:09:39.810
I don't want to be the only one to flunk out.

00:09:40.560 --> 00:09:44.460
I wanna see it, too.  Please!

00:10:07.440 --> 00:10:11.360
The Day of the Exam

00:10:16.260 --> 00:10:17.450
Begin!

00:10:21.070 --> 00:10:27.480
Everyone worked hard on the subjects they were good at, and also on the ones they were bad at.

00:10:42.440 --> 00:10:46.370
The long summer vacation began after the exam.

00:10:47.260 --> 00:10:51.560
Did you hear?  Tomura-senpai passed the Graduation Trial Exam with the highest score.

00:10:51.560 --> 00:10:55.840
Despite that, he's going to stay at Kazalm for another year and study.

00:10:56.710 --> 00:11:01.520
I'm glad that you all passed your second year of Junior High.

00:11:01.520 --> 00:11:05.570
With this, you'll all proceed to your first year of High School.

00:11:06.520 --> 00:11:09.050
You really won't come to my place?

00:11:09.050 --> 00:11:11.010
Everyone would love to have you over.

00:11:11.010 --> 00:11:15.280
I'll be fine.  Karisa-san, Nukku-san, and Mokku-san will be around.

00:11:19.490 --> 00:11:21.380
That hairpin...

00:11:23.200 --> 00:11:26.180
It really is for his girlfriend, I bet.

00:11:28.620 --> 00:11:30.760
I'd better go ask him!

00:11:32.080 --> 00:11:34.610
Kashugan, you bought a hairpin, right?

00:11:36.350 --> 00:11:38.510
Ah, you mean this?

00:11:40.100 --> 00:11:42.260
It's a souvenir for my big sis.

00:11:42.260 --> 00:11:44.930
She's already married,

00:11:44.930 --> 00:11:48.430
but she always tells me to return with something for her.

00:11:49.850 --> 00:11:53.400
I see.  I never knew you had an older sister.

00:11:53.400 --> 00:11:56.380
You're so kind, Kashugan.

00:11:56.380 --> 00:11:59.650
Yeah well, keeping the older sibling happy is part of the younger one's job.

00:12:00.720 --> 00:12:02.870
Aren't you glad it wasn't a broken heart?

00:12:04.870 --> 00:12:05.900
What?

00:12:05.900 --> 00:12:08.080
It's nothing.

00:12:14.130 --> 00:12:17.090
Will you really be all right staying behind?

00:12:17.420 --> 00:12:20.750
Yup.  I want to stay near Lilan, too.

00:12:20.750 --> 00:12:21.600
I see.

00:12:21.600 --> 00:12:22.750
We're leaving.

00:12:22.750 --> 00:12:25.210
I won't see you for a while, but take care.

00:12:25.210 --> 00:12:26.940
Yeah.  You too, Yuuyan.

00:12:26.940 --> 00:12:28.810
I'll see you next school year!

00:12:28.810 --> 00:12:31.590
Don't forget about me!

00:12:31.590 --> 00:12:33.740
Be careful of the heat!

00:12:33.740 --> 00:12:36.910
Don't fall asleep with your stomach exposed!

00:13:01.680 --> 00:13:04.090
Lilan, it's summer break.

00:13:04.460 --> 00:13:07.050
The exam is over, and there are no classes.

00:13:07.050 --> 00:13:11.020
I'll get to be with you from morning to night.

00:13:11.640 --> 00:13:13.320
All day long.

00:13:50.330 --> 00:13:52.470
Step outside.  I'll clean out your stall.

00:13:58.770 --> 00:14:01.480
Very good, child.

00:14:10.810 --> 00:14:13.740
Don't come in yet, Lilan.  I'm still cleaning.

00:14:13.740 --> 00:14:14.830
Go on, get out.

00:14:21.960 --> 00:14:24.390
You understood my words?

00:14:26.370 --> 00:14:27.930
Of course not.

00:14:28.900 --> 00:14:30.150
I'm done.

00:14:32.980 --> 00:14:34.730
Okay, you can come in, Lilan!

00:14:43.430 --> 00:14:46.490
I'm not using the harp at all.

00:14:51.030 --> 00:14:53.290
Lilan, do you understand my words?

00:14:54.610 --> 00:14:57.790
You can understand what I'm saying?

00:15:07.880 --> 00:15:08.930
That's one.

00:15:12.720 --> 00:15:13.700
Two.

00:15:17.480 --> 00:15:18.850
Three.

00:15:23.910 --> 00:15:27.110
Lilan understands my words.

00:15:27.110 --> 00:15:34.080
If I combine the harp and some motions, Lilan will probably understand more things.

00:15:34.850 --> 00:15:37.540
What is Erin-chan doing?

00:15:40.450 --> 00:15:43.260
"I've had enough of this heat!"

00:15:43.260 --> 00:15:45.960
"I don't want to work anymore!"

00:15:47.050 --> 00:15:47.960
"Bye!"

00:15:47.960 --> 00:15:50.510
That's just what you're thinking.

00:15:59.710 --> 00:16:02.900
I'll be done soon, so hold on for a little more, Lilan.

00:16:39.510 --> 00:16:43.520
<i>Beast-lords will never befriend humans.</i>

00:16:50.880 --> 00:16:52.980
Can you move, Lilan?

00:17:23.020 --> 00:17:24.400
Lilan...

00:17:43.750 --> 00:17:45.080
Lilan.

00:17:46.180 --> 00:17:49.210
Beast-lords were supposed to never befriend humans.

00:17:49.210 --> 00:17:54.320
However, in Erin, Lilan saw a maternal figure.

00:17:54.860 --> 00:17:59.300
Erin was also very happy about that.

00:18:06.340 --> 00:18:08.900
They look like they're having a great time.

00:18:09.630 --> 00:18:11.650
You can go play with them, you know.

00:18:13.570 --> 00:18:16.350
Not with me.  Them.

00:18:17.650 --> 00:18:19.450
I'm saying <i>not</i> me.

00:18:20.100 --> 00:18:23.370
You should get to know others and not only me.

00:18:28.350 --> 00:18:29.880
Just me?

00:18:50.050 --> 00:18:53.480
What's the matter?  What brings you here all of a sudden?

00:18:54.470 --> 00:18:56.380
Did something happen?

00:18:56.380 --> 00:19:00.350
It seems like Lilan understands me.

00:19:00.350 --> 00:19:03.200
I don't have to use the harp.  Just through words.

00:19:03.960 --> 00:19:05.530
"Through words?"

00:19:05.530 --> 00:19:10.000
Though, only simple words like, "wait" and "stop."

00:19:10.000 --> 00:19:11.710
That's unbelievable.

00:19:11.710 --> 00:19:14.680
A beast-lord understanding human words?

00:19:16.970 --> 00:19:20.930
I want to teach more words to Lilan, but...

00:19:21.720 --> 00:19:23.640
Is there something that worries you?

00:19:24.990 --> 00:19:32.690
If this goes on, Lilan may remember my words, but might not remember the beast-lords' words.

00:19:36.190 --> 00:19:46.120
I thought, at this rate, Lilan will be able to live with humans, but won't be able to live with wild beast-lords.

00:19:49.280 --> 00:19:52.660
You're right.  You have a point.

00:19:52.660 --> 00:19:56.720
But that's nothing for you to worry about.

00:19:56.720 --> 00:20:00.760
Why not?  Lilan won't be able to return to the wild at this rate.

00:20:01.590 --> 00:20:05.560
Lilan was a gift to the Queen.

00:20:05.560 --> 00:20:10.210
It can never return to the wild.

00:21:16.490 --> 00:21:28.240
A strong wind blows from forest to forest.
kaze ga tsuyoku fuite mori kara mori he

00:21:28.840 --> 00:21:41.020
Everything gets blown away to far places.
nanimo kamo tooku he fuki tobashite shimau

00:21:41.430 --> 00:21:54.060
It'll soon turn into a storm. Over the plain,
mou sugu arashi ni naru nohara wo koete

00:21:54.170 --> 00:22:05.710
it will come to my place, too.
watashi no tokoro nimo yatte kuru

00:22:07.710 --> 00:22:10.930
The clouds in the summer sky...

00:22:10.930 --> 00:22:16.400
Lilan could only see these clouds from within Kazalm's limits.

00:22:16.730 --> 00:22:21.360
As a result, Erin felt very sad for Lilan.

00:22:21.360 --> 00:22:28.620
She was also very frustrated that she couldn't express that to Lilan.

00:24:02.070 --> 00:24:04.480
During summer break when no one is around...

00:24:04.480 --> 00:24:11.030
When the night with its deep fog arrives, this place seemingly becomes no longer like Kazalm.

00:24:11.030 --> 00:24:20.030
A mysterious light from within the fog lures lost students into the scary Hikara.

00:24:21.860 --> 00:24:25.050
Kemono no Souja Erin.  Fallen to Hikara.

00:24:25.050 --> 00:24:32.520
Fallen to Hikara
